body: "Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1487\n\nReported safety failure: an agent ran config set before init in a separate nested repository and changed the enclosing tracker; append-only outer history retained that mistake after restoration. Do not test against the real tracker or repair historical entries destructively. Investigate the SDK discovery primitive and all mutation/read adapters, then document compatibility for users intentionally sharing a parent tracker."
